     "at": null,
     "text": "1933",
     "big": true
    },
    {
     "at": "California",
     "text": "CALTECH, CALIFORNIA"
    },
    {
     "at": "Swiss",
     "text": "Swiss astronomer Fritz Zwicky was stuck on a strange calculation"
    },
    {
     "at": "लगभग तीस",
     "text": "About 300 million light-years away..."
    },
    {
     "at": "हज़ार से",
     "text": "...a giant swarm of more than 1,000 galaxies"
    },
    {
     "at": "Coma Cluster",
     "text": "THE COMA CLUSTER",
     "big": true
    },
    {
     "at": "Zwicky ने इन",
     "text": "He calculated how fast its galaxies were moving"
    },
    {
     "at": "और कुछ गड़बड़",
     "text": "...and something didn't add up"
    },
    {
     "at": "Galaxies इतनी",
     "text": "The galaxies were racing far too fast"
    },
    {
     "at": "कि दिखने",
     "text": "Even the gravity of all the visible stars couldn't hold them"
    },
    {
     "at": "Cluster को",
     "text": "The cluster should have flown apart long ago"
    },
    {
     "at": "फिर भी वह",
     "text": "Yet it held together..."
    },
    {
     "at": "जैसे कोई",
     "text": "...as if an invisible hand was holding it"
    },
    {
     "at": "Zwicky ने उस",
     "text": "Zwicky gave the unknown stuff a name..."
    },
    {
